WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:06.913 --> 00:00:08.113
&gt;&gt; Tucker: ONE OF THE MOST

00:00:08.114 --> 00:00:09.648
REMARKABLE AND TROUBLING MOMENTS

00:00:09.649 --> 00:00:12.751
IN THE YEARS LONG RUSSIA TSONGA

00:00:12.752 --> 00:00:14.486
OCCURRED WHEN THE FORMER DEPUTY

00:00:14.487 --> 00:00:18.957
FBI DIRECTOR ANDY McCABE CLAIMED

00:00:18.958 --> 00:00:19.891
THAT ROD ROSENSTEIN OFFERED TO W

00:00:19.892 --> 00:00:19.925
THAT ROD ROSENSTEIN OFFERED TO A

00:00:19.926 --> 00:00:19.958
THAT ROD ROSENSTEIN OFFERED TO R

00:00:19.959 --> 00:00:20.058
THAT ROD ROSENSTEIN OFFERED TO A

00:00:20.059 --> 00:00:20.091
THAT ROD ROSENSTEIN OFFERED TO W

00:00:20.092 --> 00:00:20.191
THAT ROD ROSENSTEIN OFFERED TO O

00:00:20.192 --> 00:00:20.225
THAT ROD ROSENSTEIN OFFERED TO S

00:00:20.226 --> 00:00:20.258
THAT ROD ROSENSTEIN OFFERED TO Y

00:00:20.259 --> 00:00:20.358
THAT ROD ROSENSTEIN OFFERED TO H

00:00:20.359 --> 00:00:20.592
THAT ROD ROSENSTEIN OFFERED TO E

00:00:20.593 --> 00:00:21.293
PRESIDENT.

00:00:21.294 --> 00:00:24.296
NOW AT THE TIME ROSENSTEIN

00:00:24.297 --> 00:00:26.731
DENIED IT BUT TODAY JUDICIAL

00:00:26.732 --> 00:00:28.600
WATCH ANNOUNCED A TWO-PAGE MEMO

00:00:28.601 --> 00:00:31.970
FROM MAY OF 2017 IN WHICH

00:00:31.971 --> 00:00:32.604
McCABE RECORDS ROSENSTEIN

00:00:32.605 --> 00:00:33.939
MAKING THAT OFFER.

00:00:33.940 --> 00:00:35.140
IT'S ACCORDING TO THE MEMO,

00:00:35.141 --> 00:00:35.807
ROSENSTEIN THOUGHT HE COULD

00:00:35.808 --> 00:00:37.542
SNEAK A Y OR N BECAUSE HE WAS

00:00:37.543 --> 00:00:39.945
NOT SEARCHED WHEN VISITING THE

00:00:39.946 --> 00:00:45.984
WHITE HOUSE.

00:00:45.985 --> 00:00:49.554
WHAT DO YOU MAKE THIS REPORT?

00:00:49.555 --> 00:00:51.556
&gt;&gt; LAW, THE MEMO AND IN AND OF

00:00:51.557 --> 00:00:52.290
ITSELF IS EXTRAORDINARY BECAUSE

00:00:52.291 --> 00:00:54.826
IT CAPTURES A MOMENT IN TIME

00:00:54.827 --> 00:00:56.061
BETWEEN THE FIRING OF JIM COMEY

00:00:56.062 --> 00:00:57.762
AND THE APPOINTMENT OF THE

00:00:57.763 --> 00:00:59.864
SPECIAL COUNSEL AND IT

00:00:59.865 --> 00:01:01.533
REALLY TO SOME EXTENT LAYS OUT

00:01:01.534 --> 00:01:02.901
THE ENTIRE CONVERSATION THAT

00:01:02.902 --> 00:01:08.106
ANDY McCABE AS ACTING DEPUTY

00:01:08.107 --> 00:01:09.240
FBI DIRECTOR HAD WITH DEPUTY

00:01:09.241 --> 00:01:09.975
ATTORNEY GENERAL ROSENSTEIN AND

00:01:09.976 --> 00:01:12.811
OTHERS AND I JUST THINK IT'S

00:01:12.812 --> 00:01:13.478
EXTRAORDINARY THAT THEY WERE

00:01:13.479 --> 00:01:15.981
HAVING A DISCUSSION, WHETHER OR

00:01:15.982 --> 00:01:18.817
NOT IT WAS A JOKE, AS I'VE HEARD

00:01:18.818 --> 00:01:20.018
ROSENSTEIN ALLEGE, OF WEARING A

00:01:20.019 --> 00:01:23.188
WIRE INTO THE WHITE HOUSE IN THE

00:01:23.189 --> 00:01:23.955
OVAL OFFICE AND RECORDING THE

00:01:23.956 --> 00:01:26.124
PRESIDENT.

00:01:26.125 --> 00:01:28.326
IT I CAN IMAGINE UNDER WHAT

00:01:28.327 --> 00:01:29.027
CIRCUMSTANCE DOES CONVERSATION

00:01:29.028 --> 00:01:31.630
WOULD'VE COME OUT AND WOULD HAVE

00:01:31.631 --> 00:01:32.797
BEEN HAVE BETWEEN THOSE

00:01:32.798 --> 00:01:33.264
TWO PEOPLE.

00:01:33.265 --> 00:01:34.466
&gt;&gt; Tucker: SO I MEAN YOU WERE

00:01:34.467 --> 00:01:35.433
TO AT THIS LEVEL OF GOVERNMENT

00:01:35.434 --> 00:01:35.934
FOR A LONG TIME.

00:01:35.935 --> 00:01:36.968
ASSESS THE LIKELIHOOD THAT IT

00:01:36.969 --> 00:01:40.038
WAS A JOKE.

00:01:40.039 --> 00:01:43.408
&gt;&gt; AT THE TIME, I WAS THE CHIEF

00:01:43.409 --> 00:01:47.345
OF STAFF WHEN ROSENSTEIN ISSUED

00:01:47.346 --> 00:01:48.446
THAT EXTRAORDINARY STATEMENT AND

00:01:48.447 --> 00:01:49.714
THEN ANOTHER STATEMENT ON TOP OF

00:01:49.715 --> 00:01:51.850
THAT IN THE FIRST ONE WASN'T

00:01:51.851 --> 00:01:54.119
RECEIVED WELL AND THAT THE STORY

00:01:54.120 --> 00:01:57.522
WAS COVERED BY MANY AND IT WAS

00:01:57.523 --> 00:01:58.256
OBVIOUSLY THE ONLY EXPLANATION

00:01:58.257 --> 00:01:58.990
THAT HE COULD HAVE STAYED IN

00:01:58.991 --> 00:02:00.058
THAT ROLE IF IT HAD BEEN A

00:02:00.059 --> 00:02:03.628
SERIOUS CONSIDERATION OF WEARING

00:02:03.629 --> 00:02:05.563
A WIRE INTO THE OVAL OFFICE AND

00:02:05.564 --> 00:02:06.297
OBVIOUSLY THE PRESIDENT COULDN'T

00:02:06.298 --> 00:02:08.733
HAVE THE TRUST AND CONFIDENCE SO

00:02:08.734 --> 00:02:11.069
HE HAD TO EXPLAIN IT AS BEING A

00:02:11.070 --> 00:02:13.571
JOKE AND SAYING THAT AS A

00:02:13.572 --> 00:02:14.673
FACETIOUS MATTER.

00:02:14.674 --> 00:02:15.640
I DON'T KNOW --

00:02:15.641 --> 00:02:16.675
I THINK THERE WERE OTHERS IN

00:02:16.676 --> 00:02:19.110
THAT SAME MEETING THAT ALSO TOOK

00:02:19.111 --> 00:02:19.544
COPIOUS NOTES.

00:02:19.545 --> 00:02:21.946
I WOULD EXPECT THAT SINCE THEY

00:02:21.947 --> 00:02:24.416
DO SUCH A GOOD JOB WE WILL SEE

00:02:24.417 --> 00:02:25.650
THOSE CONTEMPORARY NOTES AS WELL

00:02:25.651 --> 00:02:27.419
BECAUSE I THINK WE ARE FAR FROM

00:02:27.420 --> 00:02:29.387
OVER BUT THE PROSECUTOR IN ME

00:02:29.388 --> 00:02:31.556
WANTS TO CORROBORATE THE STORY

00:02:31.557 --> 00:02:32.290
AND ANY McCABE AT THE TIME HAD

00:02:32.291 --> 00:02:35.994
A LOT OF REASONS TO WRITE DOWN

00:02:35.995 --> 00:02:37.762
HIS HISTORICALLY INACCURATE

00:02:37.763 --> 00:02:39.431
ACCOUNTS BECAUSE HE HAD JUST PUT

00:02:39.432 --> 00:02:41.800
THE PRESIDENT INTO THIS

00:02:41.801 --> 00:02:42.467
INVESTIGATION IS THE TARGET.

00:02:42.468 --> 00:02:44.002
&gt;&gt; Tucker: SO I GUESS THE

00:02:44.003 --> 00:02:45.236
OBVIOUS QUESTION IS, DO YOU

00:02:45.237 --> 00:02:47.272
THINK, AND YOU KNOW HIM,

00:02:47.273 --> 00:02:49.274
ROD ROSENSTEIN, IS CAPABLE OF

00:02:49.275 --> 00:02:50.775
THAT?

00:02:50.776 --> 00:02:54.379
&gt;&gt; YOU KNOW, I WORKED

00:02:54.380 --> 00:02:55.113
SIDE-BY-SIDE WITH ROD AS DEPUTY

00:02:55.114 --> 00:02:56.047
ATTORNEY GENERAL WHEN I WAS

00:02:56.048 --> 00:02:56.915
ACTING ATTORNEY GENERAL AND I

00:02:56.916 --> 00:02:58.450
ALSO WORKED WITH HIM WHEN I WAS

00:02:58.451 --> 00:02:58.917
CHIEF OF STAFF.

00:02:58.918 --> 00:03:01.186
I WOULD BE SURPRISED IF HE HAD

00:03:01.187 --> 00:03:02.587
HONESTLY SAID THAT HE WOULD WEAR

00:03:02.588 --> 00:03:04.222
A WIRE BUT AT THE SAME TIME IF

00:03:04.223 --> 00:03:05.757
YOU READ THE MEMO, IT'S VERY

00:03:05.758 --> 00:03:07.525
CLEAR THAT ANDY McCABE DIDN'T

00:03:07.526 --> 00:03:08.393
THINK ROD WAS JOKING AND I WOULD

00:03:08.394 --> 00:03:10.228
LIKE TO SEE WHAT OTHERS IN THE

00:03:10.229 --> 00:03:11.296
ROOM THOUGHT BECAUSE I WAS NOT

00:03:11.297 --> 00:03:12.931
IN THE ROOM AT THE TIME AND I

00:03:12.932 --> 00:03:14.399
THINK IT WOULD BE A --

00:03:14.400 --> 00:03:15.533
IT IS SOMETHING I THINK THAT IS

00:03:15.534 --> 00:03:17.302
JUST SO EXTRAORDINARY THAT IT

00:03:17.303 --> 00:03:18.770
NEEDS TO BE TALKED ABOUT WHETHER

00:03:18.771 --> 00:03:21.039
YOU ARE JOKING OR NOT THAT I

00:03:21.040 --> 00:03:22.006
THINK WE NEED A FEW MORE

00:03:22.007 --> 00:03:24.343
WITNESSES TO THAT CONVERSATION

